    "text": "<p>The logic gate equivalent to the given circuit diagram is :</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/2fc50d1d-7921-44bb-b9a1-436b9d03de9c-9893962.PNG\" style=\"width: 283px; height: 330px;\" /></p>",
